From f556631cdc73dc6c1fad1d1850edb5216430dc99 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: QC3284 <2078725082@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 12:14:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 39/39] board: zte: extend the web rescue to the v2.1 endpoints

Add the v2.1 endpoints to e2631rescue: GET /slots, /env and /backup
(bootloader plus the four small partitions, streamed in 16 KiB blocks
with CRC32/SHA-256 headers), POST /firmware (package validation and the
guarded slot write through e2631fwslot), /boot (one-shot
e2631_next_slot override), /factory (rootfs_data erase through
e2631factory), /env (staged e2631env write) and /console (one command
with a 4 KiB tail capture and no stdin sharing). /status grows the v2
keys and keeps the v1 ones unchanged. The defconfig enables
CONFIG_CONSOLE_RECORD with a 16 KiB ring for the capture.

Signed-off-by: QC3284 <2078725082@qq.com>
